---
config:
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: '"Noto Sans CJK SC", "PingFang SC", sans-serif'
---
flowchart TD
    Frame["带标记帧到达 eth0"]
    Strip{"硬件去除 VLAN 标记？"}
    HwStripped["已设置 skb->vlan_tci<br/>skb->vlan_proto = 0x8100<br/>帧看起来没有标记"]
    SwTagged["帧仍带有标记<br/>type 字段 = 0x8100"]

    Lookup["__vlan_hwaccel_get_tag<br/>识别 vlan_id"]
    Find["按 (eth0, vlan_id)<br/>查找 VLAN netdev"]
    Found{"找到 VLAN 设备？"}
    Forward["将 skb 重定向到该<br/>VLAN netdev 的 RX 队列"]
    Drop["丢弃（没有监听方）"]

    Frame --> Strip
    Strip -->|是| HwStripped --> Lookup
    Strip -->|否| SwTagged --> Lookup
    Lookup --> Find --> Found
    Found -->|是| Forward
    Found -->|否| Drop

    classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    classDef bad fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626
    classDef hot fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
    class Forward ok
    class Drop bad
    class Strip,Found hot
